config SDRV_ACMP
    bool "Taishan ACMP Driver Support"
    depends on TAISHAN_ADC
    default n
    ---help---
    The Analog Comparator (ACMP) controller is a built-in analog compare
    module with multiple analog input channels and external analog mux
    control. The ACMP supports continuous, windowed, sampled and filtered
    compare modes.
